<BRK/>
<NPR>When PHASED CONSTRUCTION is selected, the subpart Phased Construction is included, and the subpart Submittal and 
Work Schedule is edited, to define the specific phasing sequence intended by the design.  When NO PHASED CONSTRUCTION 
is selected, the subpart Phased Construction is not included.</NPR><BRK/>
