Zone, ASHRAE 62.1 – Minimum Exhaust Airflow requirements, and, as applicable to the project, other minimum OA 
and EA airflow criteria.  Additionally, coordinate TAB tolerances to achieve proper building pressurization.  
Ensure equipment schedules, systems' capacity and allowed leakage support TAB tolerance strategy.</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
