<BRK/>
[<OLI LEVEL="2">OA<MET> 23.5 L/s</MET><ENG> 50 CFM</ENG> or less: plus<MET> 2.35 L/s</MET><ENG> 5 CFM</ENG> to minus<MET> zero L/s</MET><ENG> zero CFM</ENG></OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
][<OLI LEVEL="2">EA<MET> 23.5 L/s</MET><ENG> 50 CFM</ENG> or less: plus<MET> zero L/s</MET><ENG> zero CFM</ENG> to minus<MET> 2.35 L/s</MET><ENG> 5 CFM</ENG></OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
][<OLI LEVEL="2">SA and RA of 100 percent recirculating single-zone air-handing equipment: plus or minus 10 percent</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
][<OLI LEVEL="2">SA and RA<MET> 23.5 L/s</MET><ENG> 50 CFM</ENG> or less: plus or minus<MET> 1.42 L/s</MET><ENG> 3 CFM</ENG></OLI><BRK/>
