[<OLI LEVEL="2">Occupied Mode; air-handling equipment and fans in maximum cooling, maximum design airflow.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
][<OLI LEVEL="2">Occupied Mode; air-handling equipment with all zones satisfied such as VAVs at minimum design airflow.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
][<OLI LEVEL="2">Occupied Mode; air-handling equipment in full Economizer Mode.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
][<OLI LEVEL="2">Occupied Mode; air-handling equipment in Demand Controlled Ventilation Occupied-Standby Mode.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
][<OLI LEVEL="2">[_____]</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/>
]<LST>Measure differential pressure for the following locations: [_____][, _____].</LST><BRK/>
